# Sources of the object-model witness study (study/r2/gap-object-model-witness.md). The 2000 thesis text is 2.3.1; the axioms file is 2.1.1. Files of the 2000 archive lie outside every repository and are cited through the report, 2.20.1.

n: 2.20
name: object-model-witness-sources
kind: hub
is: The files the object-model witness study cites: its own report, two companion texts on the 2000 object model, the 2026 thesis-lane grammar and lowering, the class surface, the support list, the verdict file, the fixture band with two fixtures and its door, the class-model proof band, three commits and one deleted receipt read from git history, and the first-round critique.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r2/gap-object-model-witness

n: 2.20.1
name: gap-object-model-witness.md
kind: source
is: The study report closing gap G6 of the first-round critique, 577 lines: the reference pair, the two-base rule, delegation, casts and templates as specified in 2000, as built in 2000 and in 2026, with twelve records of execution. It cites machine and compiler source, class files and run logs of a 2000 archive on local disk outside every repository.
